#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0246 expect=violation domain=ADTTE
#note "EMPTY-DATASET PIN, expectation CORRECTED at stage-G escalation. CNSR declared (ADT/ADTM absent - the firing shape), zero rows. The Check is 100% dataset-constant, so BroadcastFold.fold decides it against the declared column schema BEFORE the 0-row synthetic zero-column table is ever built: var_exists(CNSR) and not var_exists(ADT) and not var_exists(ADTM) folds TRUE -> datasetBroadcastResult emits exactly one violation, reported at row=1 (no value pin - a zero-row table yields an empty extracted value). Was PMDA-AD0246-valid_empty_dataset-ADTTE.cdt / expect=noViolation / count=0; renamed and inverted, not duplicated."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADTTE structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col CNSR    type=Num
